# Season of Loss with {P} twice and {P}{P}{P}, five pawprints (CR 700.2d, 700.2i): each player sacrifices a creature, twice,
# first, as the modes run in printed order - the caster both of theirs, the opponent two of their three - so the
# {P}{P}{P}'s X, the creature cards in its caster's graveyard counted as it resolves, is 2: their own Memnite and
# Ornithopter, not the opponent's, and not the Season itself. One pawprint's worth more than five is refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Season of Loss
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Season of Loss.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(1; 1; 3; 1)
Bot1.Modes(1; 1; 3)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
? Bot2.Life = 18

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
